    "summary": "Depressed and retired as a used car salesman, Wade Wilson is abducted on his birthday by rogue TVA bureaucrat Paradox. Learning his Earth-10005 universe is slowly decaying following the noble death of its \"Anchor Being\" Wolverine, Wade steals a TemPad to search the multiverse for a replacement Logan. Finding an alcoholic, guilt-ridden variant deemed the worst Wolverine across the multiverse, both are pruned into the Void. There, they contend with Charles Xavier's telepathic twin sister Cassandra Nova and assemble forgotten legacy superheroes to save Wade's timeline.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Joined by legacy icons Elektra, Blade, Gambit, and X-23 (Laura), the heroes storm Cassandra's compound inside a gigantic Ant-Man skeleton. Returning to London, Wade and Logan hold hands to absorb the antimatter stream of the Time Ripper, disintegrating Cassandra Nova while surviving through combined healing factors to dine with their chosen family.",
