    "summary": "Stripped of Stark technology, Avengers connections, and personal relationships by Doctor Strange's global memory wipe, twenty-one-year-old Peter Parker attends Empire State University while sewing his own cloth suits. Working double shifts and volunteering at the F.E.A.S.T. homeless shelter, Peter bonds with benevolent philanthropist Martin Li. However, when lethal Inner Demons gangsters flood Chinatown wielding black-and-white inverted energy weapons, Peter crosses paths with ruthless vigilante Frank Castle (The Punisher), struggling to preserve his strict no-kill code amidst rising gang warfare.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Martin Li is unmasked as Mister Negative, corrupted by darkforce experimentation. Partnering with Mac Gargan (The Scorpion), Li attempts to poison Manhattan with the Devil's Breath bioweapon. Spider-Man intervenes to prevent Frank Castle from executing Li, using his classic webbing and agile street fighting to dismantle Scorpion's cybernetic tail.",
