    "summary": "Consuming raw grief over Vision's tragic demise in Infinity War, Wanda Maximoff experiences a supernatural emotional rupture, creating an idyllic, suburban alternate reality inside Westview, New Jersey. Trapped beneath a glowing hexagonal anomaly (The Hex), Wanda and a reincarnated Vision star in decades-spanning classic American sitcoms. As S.W.O.R.D. agent Monica Rambeau, FBI agent Jimmy Woo, and astrophysicist Darcy Lewis investigate the perimeter, nosy neighbor Agnes is revealed as ancient Salem witch Agatha Harkness seeking Wanda's primeval Chaos Magic.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Agatha is defeated when Wanda casts anti-magic runes across the Hex perimeter, formally awakening as the mythical Scarlet Witch. Wanda tearfully bids farewell to her conjured Vision and twin boys Tommy and Billy as she dissolves the Hex, going into isolation on a remote mountain to study the dark secrets of the Darkhold.",
