    "summary": "Reluctant to take up Steve Rogers' shield, Sam Wilson donates the artifact to the Smithsonian, only to watch the U.S. government award the Captain America mantle to decorated combat hero John Walker. Re-uniting with Bucky Barnes, who attends court-mandated therapy for Winter Soldier atrocities, the pair investigate the Flag Smashers—a populist anarchist cell led by enhanced teenager Karli Morgenthau. Teaming with imprisoned mastermind Helmut Zemo to trace illicit super-soldier serum, Sam grapples with systemic racism while defining Captain America.",
    "spoilerSummary": "John Walker takes super-soldier serum and public decapitates a surrendered Flag Smasher in a European plaza with the shield. Sam and Bucky disarm Walker in an industrial warehouse duel. Sam commissions a hybrid vibranium-wing flight suit from Wakanda, flying into New York as the new Captain America and inspiring the GRC council.",
