    "summary": "Aiming to spend a peaceful Christmas in New York City with his family, Clint Barton is sidelined when twenty-two-year-old archery prodigy Kate Bishop unwittingly dons his former vigilante Ronin suit at a black-market auction. Pursued by the Tracksuit Mafia, Clint takes Kate under his wing to safely retire the suit. As Clint wrestles with profound hearing loss and guilt over Natasha's death, deaf martial artist Maya Lopez seeks Ronin for murdering her father, while vengeful assassin Yelena Belova arrives in Manhattan with orders to execute Hawkeye.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Clint reconciles with Yelena on an ice rink, revealing Natasha willingly sacrificed herself on Vormir. Kate defeats her corrupt mother Eleanor and uncovers her ties to crime boss Wilson Fisk (Kingpin). Maya shoots Fisk in an alleyway, while Clint returns home to Iowa on Christmas Day with Kate and one-eyed dog Lucky, burning the Ronin suit in a firepit.",
