    "spoilerSummary": "Marc and Steven journey through the Duat, uncovering Marc's childhood trauma of losing his younger brother. Reaching balance, Marc is revived, joining wife Layla El-Faouly (the Scarlet Scarab) to bind Ammit into Harrow's mortal vessel. While Marc and Steven negotiate freedom from Khonshu, Khonshu's secret third personality—ruthless Spanish cab driver Jake Lockley—executes Harrow in a psychiatric limousine.",
