    "summary": "Los Angeles deputy district attorney Jennifer Walters crashes into a Sakaaran spaceship alongside cousin Bruce Banner, inadvertently cross-contaminating her bloodstream with his gamma-irradiated blood. Unlike Bruce, Jen retains her full personality and consciousness when transforming into a six-foot-seven green powerhouse. Hired by prestigious law firm GLK&H to head their superhuman law division, Jen defends eccentric metahumans like Emil Blonsky (Abomination) and Wong, while breaking the fourth wall to talk to the audience about misogynistic online trolls.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Incels in toxic hate-group Intelligencia steal Jen's blood at a gala. Fed up with the chaotic clichéd brawl finale, Jen literally climbs out of her Disney+ app interface into Marvel Studios production offices on the Disney lot. Confronting K.E.V.I.N. (an AI algorithm wearing a baseball cap), Jen negotiates a sensible ending where villains are prosecuted legally, Matt Murdock visits for dinner, and Bruce returns from Sakaar with son Skaar.",
