    "summary": "Shot in rich atmospheric monochrome with 1930s-style film-grain and vintage cigarette burns, this Special Presentation follows a clandestine cabal of elite monster hunters convening at Bloodstone Manor following the death of patriarch Ulysses Bloodstone. Competing in a deadly labyrinth to claim the supernatural Bloodstone relic by hunting a captured beast, gentle hunter Jack Russell has a secret agenda: liberating his friend Ted (Man-Thing). When bloodthirsty widow Verussa uses the stone's crimson radiance, Jack is forced into a terrifying lycanthropic transformation.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Jack transforms into the feral Werewolf by Night, tearing through corrupt hunters in practical blood-splattered carnage while protecting Ulysses' estranged daughter Elsa Bloodstone. Man-Thing incinerates Verussa into a pile of ash with acidic touch. Elsa assumes ownership of Bloodstone Manor while Jack and Ted share coffee in the sunny forest, as color bleeds back into the picture.",
