    "imdbRating": 6.9,
    "summary": "Learning from Kraglin that Yondu ruined Peter Quill's childhood Christmas on Earth, empathetic empath Mantis and muscular Drax devise a secret mission to cheer him up. Flying the new ship Bowie to Hollywood, California, the alien duo misunderstands earthly culture while hunting Quill's real-life childhood hero: actor Kevin Bacon. After breaking into Bacon's festive mansion and placing him under Mantis' trance, they gift-wrap the legendary star and fly him back to Knowhere for an extravagant alien yuletide festival.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Horrified to find Kevin Bacon kidnapped under hypnotic trance, Peter demands he be freed. Once bacon learns the truth, he embraces the spirit, performing \"Here It Is Christmastime\" with alien band Old 97's. In a quiet moment by the Christmas tree, Mantis reveals she is Ego's biological daughter—making her Peter's biological sister—giving Quill the greatest holiday gift imaginable.",
