    "summary": "Aging, weary, and wracked with post-Blip trauma, Nick Fury returns to Earth from deep-space orbital station S.A.B.E.R. to confront a rogue faction of radicalized Skrulls led by ruthless insurgent Gravik. Feeling betrayed by Fury's three-decade failure to find them a promised homeworld, millions of shapeshifting Skrulls have infiltrated global governments, intelligence agencies, and world militaries. Without the Avengers, Fury must rely on loyal Skrull general Talos, MI6 operative Sonya Falsworth, and Talos' estranged daughter G'iah to prevent an engineered thermonuclear world war.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Maria Hill and Talos are murdered by Gravik. Longtime Avenger Rhodey is revealed to have been replaced by Skrull female Raava since Civil War. Gravik and G'iah both absorb \"The Harvest\"—DNA from all Avengers and Thanos from the Battle of Earth—transforming into godlike Super-Skrulls. G'iah executes Gravik, while President Ritson declares open vigilante warfare against all off-world species on Earth.",
