    "summary": "Suffering from uncontrollable \"time-slipping\" pulling his body across past, present, and future, Loki reunites with Mobius and quirky TVA repair genius O.B. (Ouroboros). With the death of He Who Remains, infinite branching timelines are choking the mechanical Temporal Loom, risking total reality meltdown. Racing across centuries to track 1893 inventor variant Victor Timely to calibrate a throughput ring, Loki spends centuries studying theoretical physics to prevent universal annihilation, only to realize the system was rigged from inception.",
    "spoilerSummary": "Realizing the Loom cannot hold infinite branches and that He Who Remains designed it to prune everything, Loki rejects the binary choice of tyranny or obliteration. Striding onto the gangway without a protective suit, Loki destroys the Loom, gathers the dying timelines with his bare hands, infuses them with his emerald magic, and weaves them into the living branches of Yggdrasil—the World Tree. Seated alone on a throne at the center of time, Loki claims his true glorious purpose as the God of Stories.",
